---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'When does the first edition come out?',
    a: 'Sunday, July 6, 2026. Between now and then, you\'ll receive The Money Wit Starter Kit with everything you need to be ready the moment the first edition lands in.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Why is there only an annual payment option?',
    a: 'Because investing is not trading. You need to give your self at least one year to see ups, downs and how things pan out for it to truly makes sense. You will get the most value by scheduling 30mins every Sunday to review and decide. To know if the Money Wit Lite sits well with you, you have a 7 day trial option.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What if I\'m new to investing?',
    a: 'The Money Wit Starter Kit is built for you. We\'ll walk you through every app and account Oler uses to invest. You don\'t need prior investing experience to see how others organise things. Just curiosity and an open mind.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What markets does Money Wit Lite cover?',
    a: 'Nigeria, African and Global Markets. The world is truly a global village, if there\'s a good deal out there, we will show you and let you know how to access it. The focus is always on what you can actually do with your money, not just what\'s happening in the world.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I cancel?',
    a: 'Yes, you can! You however retain full access for the year you\'ve paid for. No hoops, no penalties.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What\'s the founder rate?',
    a: 'The founder rate is a discounted price available only to the people who join before June 21, the people who believed early. After June 21, the price increases to the standard rate and the founder rate is gone permanently.',
  },
]
---
<section class="bg-black py-28 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <span class="block text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#FFD100] mb-5">Questions</span>
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-14">Frequently asked</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col">
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <div class="border-b border-[#FFD100]/15 py-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4">{faq.q}</h3>
          <p class="text-white/60 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm">{faq.a}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<hr class="border-none h-px bg-[#FFD100]/15" />
